WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
Hi, I'm Mat. One T. I watched Lovejoy with

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.200
my mum. She thought Ian McShane was dishy. Dad

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.700
pointed out that he was a short arse. So

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.620
this is partly nostalgia, and partly an excuse to

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.220
spend rather more time in the mid-eighties and nineties

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.060
than in the twenty-twenties.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:21.933
The plan is to revisit every episode, one review

00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:25.253
at a time. These are personal reviews: the characters,

00:00:25.673 --> 00:00:28.093
the antiques, the plotting, and the bits that have

00:00:28.093 --> 00:00:31.193
aged rather less gracefully than the furniture. There are

00:00:31.193 --> 00:00:34.673
digressions. Occasionally I may forget to post reviews if

00:00:34.673 --> 00:00:37.913
life or lethargy gets in the way.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.440
To find your way around, select a series from

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.000
the Series page. You'll see which ones I've reviewed

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.040
so far. Start with Series One, or head straight

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.820
for an old favourite. The unreviewed episodes will have

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.100
to wait until I've caught up.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:57.413
Choose an episode to open its review. Each card

00:00:57.413 --> 00:00:59.333
gives you the title and a taste of what

00:00:59.333 --> 00:00:59.973
I made of it.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:03.193
The score is at the top, out of five.

00:01:03.713 --> 00:01:06.253
A useful guide, provided you accept that the judging

00:01:06.253 --> 00:01:08.193
panel consists entirely of me.

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:11.993
Then read my review. There's a quick plot summary,

00:01:11.993 --> 00:01:15.493
followed by the longer ramble. Later reviews include a

00:01:15.493 --> 00:01:18.653
favourite moment, a good quote, a guest focus, and

00:01:18.653 --> 00:01:22.093
the Divvy Verdict. The Archive brings the published reviews

00:01:22.093 --> 00:01:25.293
together; Search helps you find a half-remembered detail.

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:29.613
Have a look around. Revisit an old favourite, discover

00:01:29.613 --> 00:01:31.853
one you'd forgotten, or tell me I've got the

00:01:31.853 --> 00:01:35.273
rating completely wrong. That's half the pleasure. The Divvy

00:01:35.273 --> 00:01:37.613
also has an Insta account, where I announce a

00:01:37.613 --> 00:01:40.073
new review to the interest of largely no one.

00:01:41.473 --> 00:01:42.633
Welcome to The Divvy.
